# Skill Invocation Required

Read `.cursor/skills/using-project-skills/SKILL.md` at session start.

Before ANY response, tool call, or file edit: if a skill matches, **Read the full SKILL.md** and follow it.

## Slash Commands

| Command | Read First |
|---|---|
| `/brainstorming` | Superpowers `brainstorming` |
| `/writing-plans` | Superpowers `writing-plans` |
| `/execute-plan` | Superpowers `subagent-driven-development` |
| `/debug` | Superpowers `systematic-debugging` |
| `/verify` | Superpowers `verification-before-completion` |
| `/context7` | `.cursor/skills/context7/SKILL.md` |
| `/prompt-log` | `.cursor/skills/prompt-log/SKILL.md` |
| `/document-review` | `.cursor/skills/document-review/SKILL.md` |
| `/commit`, `/commit-push-pr` | `.cursor/skills/commit/SKILL.md` |

## Keyword Routing

See `.cursor/hooks/route-skill-on-prompt.py` and `using-project-skills` for full mapping.

Hooks inject `HOOK [skill-name]: Read ...` messages. Treat them as mandatory routing, not suggestions.

## After Markdown Edit

`postToolUse` hook triggers `document-review`. Read `.cursor/skills/document-review/SKILL.md` before completing the turn.
